title WF05 Credit top-up via PayOS - activity
|User|
start
:Open credits tab and enter top-up amount;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Amount valid?\n(minimum and multiple of credit price)) then (no)
  :Show error;
  |User|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|LumiGap platform|
:Create PayOS payment link and a pending order;
|User|
:Confirm and go to PayOS checkout;
|PayOS|
:Create checkout and collect payment;
|User|
:Pay by QR or bank transfer;
|PayOS|
:Send webhook to LumiGap;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Webhook signature and amount valid?) then (no)
  :Reject webhook, order stays pending;
  |User|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|LumiGap platform|
:Add credits once and mark order paid;
|User|
:See updated balance and order history;
stop
@enduml
